 B) LLM tasks from evals/tasks/tier2/*.json (file creation + Recycle Bin, multi-tab web) executed by the shared waa_runner harness with the independent oracle.
Run:  python evals/tier2_composite.py [--scenarios-only] [--allow-destructive]
