"""
v18.1 Core Control Loop (the thin glue that replaces layer0_v17's file/bin branches and the "4 idle steps → give up" reflex).

    compile_goal(task) ─▶ GoalSpec ─▶ RecoveryPlanner(RouteGraph) ─▶ route executor ─▶ ActionTransaction(s) ─▶ WorldModel refresh ─▶ recompute_remaining_work ─▶ … ─▶ verdict
